            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A06-P0250 Decorative Trafalgar Door Push Plate 2-3/4\" Wide x 11\" High</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis dramatic cathedral arched rope plate, done in the Georgian style is a reproduction of the Elsley twisted rope plate circa 1880. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <b><a href=\"/products/trafalgar-rope-solid-brass-pull-and-plate-brass-accents-a06-p0251\">Trafalgar Rope Plate With Door Pull</a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Brass Accents A06-P0250 Decorative Trafalgar Push Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Flat Surface: 2-1/8\" x 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>",
